1
00:00:05,060 --> 00:00:07,450
This is where the path ends.

2
00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:10,700
Perhaps it's only just beginning.

3
00:00:20,480 --> 00:00:22,500
What if nothing answers?

4
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:25,050
Then at least we tried.

5
00:00:37,280 --> 00:00:40,150
It remembers.

6
00:00:49,320 --> 00:00:51,100
I can feel it.

7
00:00:57,280 --> 00:01:01,300
They've seen us.

8
00:01:02,450 --> 00:01:04,150
We're not alone.

9
00:01:10,200 --> 00:01:11,650
Shall we go?

10
00:01:12,240 --> 00:01:14,600
After the first ray of sunlight.

